config.beloong.fixGlowingItemInvisibilit:
Fix: When "Render Item in Mouth" is enabled in Dragon Survival config,
if the dragon is holding an item and has the Glowing effect,
the dragon's body becomes semi-transparent.

config.beloong.fixStableHoverDrift.toolt:
Fix: When "Stable Hover" is enabled in Dragon Survival config,
after a dive ends, the dragon drifts forward;
when creative flight is enabled, the dragon drifts up.
